Propellerhead Remote Mapping File
File Format Version	1.0.0
Control Surface Manufacturer	Akai
Control Surface Model	MPK Mini Play
Map Version	1.0.0


//======================================================================
//  Thor Polysonic Synthesizer
//
//  Pads      -> reserved (no drum pads on Thor)
//  Knobs 1-4A-> filter 1/2 group        (CC21-24)
//  Knobs 1-4B-> amp envelope group      (CC25-28)
//  Joystick X-> Pitch Bend
//  Joystick Y-> Mod Wheel
//  Keyboard  -> Keyboard
//======================================================================

Scope	Propellerheads	Thor Polysonic Synthesizer
// Define Group	Keyboard Shortcut Variations	FilterMod	Env	Osc	FX
//	Control Surface Item	Key	Remotable Item	Scale	Mode

Map	_Scope		"Thor"
Map	Keyboard		Keyboard

// --- Pads (reserved) ---------------------------------
// Thor has no drum pads; the lines below are ready-to-enable templates.
//Map	Pad 1		Osc 1 Oct
//Map	Pad 2		Osc 2 Oct
//Map	Pad 3		Filter 1 Type
//Map	Pad 4		Filter 2 Type
//Map	Pad 5		LFO 1 Rate
//Map	Pad 6		LFO 1 Waveform
//Map	Pad 7		Select Previous Patch
//Map	Pad 8		Select Next Patch

// --- Knob Bank A (CC21-24): filters ------------------
Map	Knob 1 A		Filter 1 Freq
Map	Knob 2 A		Filter 1 Res
Map	Knob 3 A		Filter 2 Freq
Map	Knob 4 A		Filter 2 Res

// --- Knob Bank B (CC25-28): amplitude envelope -------
Map	Knob 1 B		Amp Env Attack
Map	Knob 2 B		Amp Env Decay
Map	Knob 3 B		Amp Env Sustain
Map	Knob 4 B		Amp Env Release

// --- Joystick / wheels ------------------------------
Map	Joystick X		Pitch Bend
Map	Joystick Y		Mod Wheel